Only past events from this request's principal count.

@id("allow_other_tools")
PERMIT any principal to perform any action in CallTool on any resource
  unless: the action == MergePullRequest

@id("merge_on_green_head")
PERMIT any principal to perform MergePullRequest on any resource
  when:
    a RunTests response with this request's pr and output passed = true occurred within the last 24 hours
    and no PushCommit response for that pr has occurred since then
